  "nodes": [
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c29c481521254b6f48f65ea"
      },
      "index": 0,
      "text": "My analysis of the recovered briefcase is that it contains an advanced [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreStarLeague],Star League]] personal interstellar communications device, which is a lot more reassuring than the alternative of it being a 'null bomb'.\n\nHowever, the device appears to be only partially functioning since it can't transmit, or at least I couldn't find a way since I am no expert in [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreHPG],HPG]] technology.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
