        "id": "JarringDefault"
      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9ce95da9c4d7a3729697b089"
      },
      "index": 2,
      "text": "If it can listen, could you use it to intercept [[DM.Factions[faction_ComStar],ComStar]]'s HPG transmissions or from anyone else?\n\nThere might be other such devices operating out there, we just haven't been listening enough to hear their transmissions.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 3,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cbd6ff163474fb532caa98d"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f36230355c1800006a",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c2d9569ea883a937b969707"
      },
      "index": 3,
      "text": "Negative Chief Virtanen, ComStar uses a different technology and they are heavily encrypted, plus there's a strong risk that any [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreSuccessorState],house]] might suffer an [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreComstarInterdiction],interdiction]] if they attempt to interfere with their monopoly on interstellar communications.\n\nPlus this device input screen makes it clear that it can only send text messages, which makes it limited considering the capacities of their HPG transmitters which include holovid.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 4,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9cb857f22b49073af92e02fa"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b98a97623035ac140056c6",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c55c0967fd38fee5206d90c"
      },
      "index": 4,
      "text": "It's also a potential threat to us, if it becomes known that we are in possession of such an object.\n\nThis device should be either destroyed or given to someone else, since we have no use for it.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "House Kurita would pay nicely for it since the Davions already got it.",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 5,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c87c20f2e68453411e99a88"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3a06230355c18000067",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cb229fa109e5d77ae2d9e1c"
      },
      "index": 5,
      "text": "Even if it's just a communications device, the potential implications are quite large... ComStar has currently the monopoly of space communications because everyone else has lost practical knowledge of translating the Kearny-Fuchida equations into functioning HPG stations.\n\nThis black box is a mortal blow to their business.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 6,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c7138e2e194499bd16a95ea"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "59b98a97623035ac140056c6",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9cb5b118306fb8288ca574d5"
      },
      "index": 6,
      "text": "Was a mortal threat since it is non-functional and there's no indication if it ever worked.\n\nAnd I am not sure now that this explains the explosion at [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreNewSyrtis],New Syrtis]] or the strange EMP emissions reported in the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LorePeriphery],Periphery]] worlds.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 7,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c275ced0edc07f620795804"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": {
        "id": "JarringDefault"
      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c515e8fbd913620392a4a0e"
      },
      "index": 7,
      "text": "What is sure is that Duke [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreMichaelHasekDavion],Michael Hasek-Davion]] somehow stole this from the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreNAIS],NAIS]] and gave it to Count von Steffelbus to research.\n\nThe rest might just be a cover story to hide the whole affair.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 8,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c6ae62e0f0e8932fb9a7892"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": null,
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "598cd3f36230355c1800006a",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c08ebb7156d70f8246b3c3d"
      },
      "index": 8,
      "text": "Perhaps but I have been investigating these reports for so long and this 'black box' is a significant find but it might not even be related to [[DM.Factions[faction_InterconnectednessUnlimited],Interconnectedness Unlimited]]'s 'Zenith Initiative'.\n\nRegardless, for now [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreBobYamagushi],Yamagushi]] should be more than satisfied with the results of this expedition and the recovery of this [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreBlackBox],black box]], even if it is non-functional.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": 9,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
          "onlyOnce": false,
          "idRef": {
            "id": "9c63cbe7c7f3055da46ace23"
          },
          "inputBypass": false,
          "auxiliaryLink": false,
          "comment": ""
        }
      ],
      "nodeType": 1,
      "truthValue": false,
      "autoFollowBranchDelay": 1,
      "inputMaxLength": 0,
      "sourceTopicRef": null,
      "subjectTopicRefs": [],
      "sourceInSceneRef": {
        "id": "JarringDefault"
      },
      "sourceWithTagInScene": "",
      "override_speaker": null,
      "speaker_override_id": "",
      "actions": null,
      "comment": ""
    },
    {
      "idRef": {
        "id": "9c9a2836fce4a9de95eae129"
      },
      "index": 9,
      "text": "Ha, that's just not a black box, that's the [[DM.BaseDescriptionDefs[LoreHolovidHPGOrb],HPG orb]].\n\nYou know, the one from the holovid show, it actually exists.",
      "branches": [
        {
          "responseText": "",
          "conditions": null,
          "actions": null,
          "nextNodeIndex": -1,
          "hideIfUnavailable": true,
